# requirements/local.txt is intentionally NOT excluded here (it was, until
# infra/docker/backend.Dockerfile's `local` stage started needing it in the
# build context to install pytest/black/ruff for local dev — see that
# stage's comment). This has no production impact: the `production` stage
# only ever runs `pip install -r requirements/production.txt`, so this
# file's mere presence in the build context/image is never acted on there.
